senses.gloss:
स्थूल—लक्ष or स्थूल—लक्ष्य, mfn. ‘having large aims or attributes’, munificent, liberal, generous, Yājñ.; MBh. &c.;
 wise, learned, W.;
 mindful of both benefits and injuries, ib.;
 taking a wide aim, shooting at a large target (-त्व n.), Śiś.

